@host = http://localhost:5041

### Ingest the sample handbook (run from the repo root so the relative path resolves)
POST {{host}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=docrag

--docrag
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="acme-handbook.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./acme-handbook.md
--docrag--

### Ask a question that the handbook answers
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How many vacation days can I carry over?", "topK": 5 }

### Ask something the handbook does not cover -> Status: InsufficientContext
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the CEO's favorite color?" }
